   197  
   198  | 单行版本 | 多行版本 |
   199  |---------|---------|
   200  | `row_id = tl.program_id(0)` | `row_offs = pid * ROWS_PER_BLOCK + 
tl.arange(0, ROWS_PER_BLOCK)` |
   201  | `grid = (M,)` | `grid = (triton.cdiv(M, ROWS_PER_BLOCK),)` |
   202  | 1D 索引 `ptr + row_id [3m* stride` | 2D 索引 `ptr + row_offs[:, None] *[0m 
stride` |
